# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` before `<context>/.dockerignore`.
# The build context is a cv_frontend checkout. In CI the checkout is clean;
# this matters for local T4a builds against a working copy that already has
# node_modules/ -- a stale host node_modules/ made `npm ci` pick the wrong
# (macOS/arm64) esbuild binary in T4a's earlier pack-build dry run.
node_modules
.git
.agents
tmp
db
**/*.test.ts
hmr.ts
README.md
AGENTS.md
.DS_Store
